[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8761.349, "timestamp": "02:26:01", "text": "天哪，这对我来说太容易了，因为它是与生俱来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8765.429, "timestamp": "02:26:05", "text": "呃，不需要任何插头。 是啊，给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8767.83, "timestamp": "02:26:07", "text": "我展示一些东西。 太好了，迪奥。 仔细"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8769.91, "timestamp": "02:26:09", "text": "想想，如果你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8772.55, "timestamp": "02:26:12", "text": "自己在做什么，但我做的大多是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8775.59, "timestamp": "02:26:15", "text": "比较简单的事，没有复杂的东西，但在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8779.429, "timestamp": "02:26:19", "text": "幕后，如果我真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8782.389, "timestamp": "02:26:22", "text": "想，我本来可以像Nati那样做，就像Nutty那样做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8788.79, "timestamp": "02:26:28", "text": "Nutty有一个非常……呃，朋友，我称之为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8792.23, "timestamp": "02:26:32", "text": "朋友端，呃，东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8795.03, "timestamp": "02:26:35", "text": "他为他的社区做了很多事情，人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8798.63, "timestamp": "02:26:38", "text": "可以兑换东西等等等等，嗯？ 但是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8801.67, "timestamp": "02:26:41", "text": "问题依然存在。 如果我允许人们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8803.91, "timestamp": "02:26:43", "text": "在 Twitch 上进行直播，那么踢人怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8806.71, "timestamp": "02:26:46", "text": "YouTube呢？ 那么，可信度呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8808.63, "timestamp": "02:26:48", "text": "这些人会如何触发一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8811.11, "timestamp": "02:26:51", "text": "事情，从而在我的直播中引发一些事情发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8813.83, "timestamp": "02:26:53", "text": "？ 正确的？ 所以我就想，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8817.51, "timestamp": "02:26:57", "text": "啊，根本没有平等可言。 我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8819.91, "timestamp": "02:26:59", "text": "每个人都这样做。 无论你身处哪个"}]